# Every file here ships byte-for-byte: the release packages are verified
# against this tree by size and SHA-256, and the skin updater checks the same
# checksums on a player's machine. Git's end-of-line translation would rewrite
# every XML and INI on a Windows checkout, so the same commit would produce
# different bytes depending on which platform packaged it -- which is exactly
# what happened when the UI package moved to a Linux runner while the release
# is still assembled and verified on Windows.
* -text
